    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awrak is where strategy meets chaos: build powerful decks, unleash a storm of projectiles, and obliterate waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay loop:</u></strong> Build insane combos with your characters and cards to reach massive numbers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691210/extras/cf1ff026dcc2bef050364e89eb83bcf6.poster.avif?t=1753973974\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691210/extras/cf1ff026dcc2bef050364e89eb83bcf6.webm?t=1753973974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691210/extras/cf1ff026dcc2bef050364e89eb83bcf6.mp4?t=1753973974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Key features:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Characters:</strong> Choose from a different set of characters, each with its own special way of attacking and upgrading. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deckbuilding:</strong> Start with plain cards and craft them into powerful versions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691210/extras/ceaaca3a83a7a24bef69b2b93a125f15.poster.avif?t=1753973974\" width=402 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691210/extras/ceaaca3a83a7a24bef69b2b93a125f15.webm?t=1753973974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691210/extras/ceaaca3a83a7a24bef69b2b93a125f15.mp4?t=1753973974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relics:</strong> Choose from over 100 unique relics, each offering distinct abilities and effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691210/extras/b41a96ff8fc42bd65465beb38651511f.avif?t=1753973974\" width=616 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empowers:</strong> Transform how your characters play by enhancing their skills and projectiles in powerful new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockables &amp; Achievements:</strong> Unlock new relics, characters, crafting options, monsters and empowers by completing achievements.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Wishlist for Demo and Release Notifications.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
